{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06MC", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU \\ar[d] & F \\ar[l]^p \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} & \\Spec(k) \\ar[l]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$U$", "MATH_0004": "$k$", "MATH_0005": "$U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$z \\in |F|$", "MATH_0007": "$F \\to \\Spec(k)$", "MATH_0008": "$z$", "MATH_0009": "$U$", "MATH_0010": "$p(z)$", "MATH_0011": "$$\nU \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{X}\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-at-point}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f4555c67966de305d1005344b9b66b46719fcd48d1f26a47999ad4caccbc325d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:02d9a3670d3bfb84c7a386f29b85889c7585f2bc3d0fdc6fe26b0ea91e2f447f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack. Consider a cartesian diagram\n<MATH_0002>\nwhere <MATH_0003> is an algebraic space, <MATH_0004> is a field, and <MATH_0005>\nis flat and locally of finite presentation. Let <MATH_0006> be such that\n<MATH_0007> is unramified at <MATH_0008>. Then, after replacing <MATH_0009> by\nan open subspace containing <MATH_0010>, the morphism\n<MATH_0011>\nis <ACCENT_0001>tale.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:dc608409cf7a5d24472a79cf1fecf1bd9964a1e569df0ada6d0be7c0abd8b17e", "unit_id": "tag:06N2:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06MC", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f : U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$W(f) \\subset U$", "MATH_0003": "$f|_{W(f)} : W(f) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$p(z)$", "MATH_0005": "$W(f)$", "MATH_0006": "$W(f)$", "MATH_0007": "$F \\to \\Spec(k)$", "MATH_0008": "$z$", "MATH_0009": "$U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$F \\to \\Spec(k)$", "MATH_0011": "$z$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-remark-local-source-apply}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-item-etale}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-unramified-flat-lfp-etale}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9e4bbc57a380a500e2386e3872c68f1d5406494143542bf0cd94f69565575146", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f2c6900460a57fd6aef49e7233656814b6442cc9a241f3c8743eee9265f475f0", "source_text": "Since <MATH_0001> is flat and locally of finite presentation\nthere exists a maximal open <MATH_0002> such that the restriction\n<MATH_0003> is <ACCENT_0001>tale, see\nProperties of Stacks, Remark\n<REF_0001>\n(<REF_0002>).\nHence all we need to do is prove that <MATH_0004> is a point of <MATH_0005>.\nMoreover, the remark referenced above also shows the formation of <MATH_0006>\ncommutes with arbitrary base change by a morphism which is representable\nby algebraic spaces. Hence it suffices to show that the morphism\n<MATH_0007> is <ACCENT_0002>tale at <MATH_0008>. Since it is flat and locally\nof finite presentation as a base change of <MATH_0009> and since\n<MATH_0010> is unramified at <MATH_0011> by assumption, this follows\nfrom\nMorphisms of Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5861d384073c5b822943c2f797c44134bc908dab50846b44f2121e8f698b4df9", "unit_id": "tag:06N2:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06MC", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:69392b937e4ddfc033f031fd28dd170ac7ded924038e9490323d15358ede1ddc", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nA DM stack is a Deligne-Mumford stack.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0be98b0f18a3a91ed4dd48dec3f5747b57196c5538a5ea16af8bdb51f072bf41", "unit_id": "tag:06MC:prose-0003"}
